        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kano niko ameera kabamakuru abarula muEsau, okhulonda khubilibwa biabwe, nende habundu wabwe, khumeera kabwe; mbu owelikuru Timina, owelikuru Alawa, owelikuru Yetsetsi; ",
          "type": "text",
